PartialFillSettler_resolveFor
├── when the order is well-formed
│   ├── it should return two outputs for the rollover and premium legs
│   ├── it should set minReceived.amount to orderSize multiplied by minPremiumPerShare divided by 1e18
│   ├── it should bake OriginFillerData.outputAmount as Output.amount
│   └── it should encode originData byte-exact in fillInstructions
└── when srcCstToken equals premiumToken
